    "description": "Responsible for the card application (FDM-Financial Data Model).  The application supported the following industries:  financial, healthcare, retail, prepaid, contactless and private label.\n\nAll card clients within the Indy plant processed through this application. The application reached multiple plants within the organization (TX and MN) for client processing.\n\nManaged several programmers and some consultants to support the growing client base along with future release development.  Worked with all departments to coordinate quarterly releases of the application.   \n\nThe programming team analyzed, documented, programmed, tested and implemented changes to the application while also supporting the existing client base.\n\nPrior to programming manager, I developed code to enhance the application feature/functionality.  As a developer, l also supervised  the IT computer operations.   OS supported involved multiple flavors of Unix and Linux.   MicroFocus COBOL was the programming language.   Unix scripts and cron development was supported.",
